{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34716","headline":"奉酬袭美苦雨四声重寄三十二句 平上声 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉酬袭美苦雨四声重寄三十二句 平上声","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"层云愁天低，久雨倚槛冷。\n丝禽藏荷香，锦鲤绕岛影。\n心将时人乖，道与隐者静。\n桐阴无深泉，所以逞短绠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34716.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34716","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}